        "id": 1470368
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-16T16:02:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we can not use TransportDiscoveryData Class, there are 2 reason.\n1. TransportDiscoveryData or Transport block class does not TdsFlagMask \u0026 TransportDataMask,these 2 parameters are only use for filtering purpose. \n\n2. As per spec TransportDiscoveryData can contains multiple Transport block, but Transport discovery data scan filtering can be added for one particular service or Transport block from a application. Same application or other app may add another TDD filter for another service.   \n Note: multiple service filtering for same TransportDiscoveryData will add implicit filter \"\u0026\u0026\"  conditions for multiple services, which  is not supported in controller \u0026  is not useful or good usecase. \nmultiple services filtering should be done with \"OR\" condition(one filter for one service), so whenever a service is found, it would be reported to application layer from BT controller \n\nspec: The structure of the Transport Block may be repeated in case there are multiple services (on the same or  different transports) to advertise simultaneously. The structure may repeat as long as there is space \navailable. These Transport Blocks may be from the same organization or from different organizations",
      "parentUuid": "aad2affc_e2e97293",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1095,
        "startChar": 92,
        "endLine": 1095,
        "endChar": 142
      },
      "revId": "a9e8d334b215a0c46c510de3e6ddfa9f001ff3cb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e78d4db8_ec035fc8",
        "filename": "framework/api/system-current.txt",
