        "id": 1121403
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-17T02:34:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In `AdvertiseData#Builder` we already have a similar method\n\nhttps://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/le/AdvertiseData.Builder#addTransportDiscoveryData(android.bluetooth.le.TransportDiscoveryData)\n\nThe scanner part should be symmetric to the advertiser part so that we can reuse the existing data structure as much as possible\n\nSee my comments in the code for more details",
      "parentUuid": "dd697d5e_5a831c27",
      "range": {
